# Environment for `make test-one T=<test name>`. Copy to .env (git-ignored) and uncomment what
# you want to change:
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# Every value below is already the default: the Makefile sets them all (DISPLAY_ENV), and .env
# only overrides. An empty or missing .env runs exactly what `make test-display` runs.
#
# Format: KEY=VALUE, one per line, with no quotes and no spaces in the value (the lines are
# passed to `env` as words). Lines starting with # are ignored. `$HOME` and `~` are NOT expanded:
# write absolute paths.
#
# The full list, with the app's own runtime variables, is in tests/qa/README.md
# ("Environment variables").

# ---- Isolation: keep tests away from your real settings, threads and keyring ----------------

# Where config.json is read and written. Default: <repo>/target/test-home/config
#XDG_CONFIG_HOME=/absolute/path/to/agent-terminal/target/test-home/config
# GLib and GTK's own user data (recently used files and the like). Default: <repo>/target/test-home/data
#XDG_DATA_HOME=/absolute/path/to/agent-terminal/target/test-home/data
# The thread store (threads.db), hand-off briefs and approval rules.
# Default: <repo>/target/test-home/state
#XDG_STATE_HOME=/absolute/path/to/agent-terminal/target/test-home/state
# The model catalogue cache. Default: <repo>/target/test-home/cache
#XDG_CACHE_HOME=/absolute/path/to/agent-terminal/target/test-home/cache
# GSettings in memory: nothing is written to your dconf database. Default: memory
#GSETTINGS_BACKEND=memory
# Git ignores the system and your global git config, so repository tests behave the same on
# every machine (CI has no git identity). Defaults: 1 and /dev/null
#GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1
#GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null

# ---- Display: what the GTK tests render on --------------------------------------------------

# The tests run on the private Xvfb display xvfb-run starts, which is X11. Default: x11
#GDK_BACKEND=x11
# GTK's test accessibility backend: no AT-SPI bus needed. Default: test
#GTK_A11Y=test
# A fixed locale, so text measurement and sorting do not depend on yours. Default: C.UTF-8
#LANG=C.UTF-8

# ---- Output ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Where layout tests save their screenshots. Unset it to take none.
# Default: <repo>/target/qa-artifacts/screenshots
#AGENT_TERMINAL_QA_ARTIFACTS=/absolute/path/to/agent-terminal/target/qa-artifacts/screenshots
# Log filter for the app's tracing output in a failing test's stderr (tracing EnvFilter syntax,
# e.g. debug or agent_terminal::window=debug). Default: unset (info)
#RUST_LOG=debug

# ---- Opt-in ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# A scratch COPY of a real threads.db, for the store's append benchmark
# (make test-one T=append_bench). Never point it at your live store. Default: unset
#AGENT_TERMINAL_BENCH_DB=/tmp/threads-copy.db
